    "title": "Manhunt ends: Carroll County double-homicide suspect found dead in Illinois - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Natalie Dattilio ,\n11 hours ago CARROLLTON, Mo. (KCTV) - A manhunt has ended after a Carrol County double-murder suspect was found dead in Illinois on Wednesday afternoon, according to the Missouri State Highway Patrol. Ryan A. Munson, 48, was found deceased from an apparent self-inflicted gunshot wound inside a RV in Decatur, Illinois. Authorities found... Read full article\n1",
